{"type":"standard","title":"John Rutherford (Florida politician)","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">John Rutherford (Florida politician)</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q6256043","titles":{"canonical":"John_Rutherford_(Florida_politician)","normalized":"John Rutherford (Florida politician)","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">John Rutherford (Florida politician)</span></span>"},"pageid":1020872,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Rutherford_John_119th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Rutherford_John_119th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":449},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/67/Rutherford_John_119th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":2444,"height":3329},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1372187030","tid":"a41ead61-a4ac-11f1-9849-0c93512e460d","timestamp":"2026-08-30T19:54:42Z","description":"American politician (born 1952)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Rutherford_(Florida_politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Rutherford_(Florida_politician)?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Rutherford_(Florida_politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:John_Rutherford_(Florida_politician)"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Rutherford_(Florida_politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/John_Rutherford_(Florida_politician)","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Rutherford_(Florida_politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:John_Rutherford_(Florida_politician)"}},"extract":"John Henry Rutherford is an American politician and former law enforcement officer serving as the U.S. representative from Florida's 5th congressional district since 2017. A member of the Republican Party, his district encompasses southeast Jacksonville and all of St. Johns County.","extract_html":"<p><b>John Henry Rutherford</b> is an American politician and former law enforcement officer serving as the U.S. representative from Florida's 5th congressional district since 2017. A member of the Republican Party, his district encompasses southeast Jacksonville and all of St. Johns County.</p>"}